WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:16.060
are you there yet since you haven't called me i'll assume you got there safely station yet

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:21.250
i hope you didn't forget anything but now that i've looked in your room

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.980
it seems like you did forget something il-san and the others take nice pictures for you

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.320
Have a great trip.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:33.370
See you, sis.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.040
"I love your eyes"

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:15.240
"The entire story is an exciting repetition"

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.220
"Let's make it a two-day event"

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.220
"Football game"

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.400
"The whole day is moot"

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.260
"Water is flowing"

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:24.930
"It's okay"

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:25.930
"Ninja Taichi"

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:26.430
"Let's go"

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:27.430
"Water is flowing"

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:27.930
"Let's go"

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:28.430
"Now"

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:29.430
"Freely"

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:29.800
"Enjoy"

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.260
Mount Fuji

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.420
Taken from the bullet train

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.140
It sounds like my sister's having a lot of fun

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.420
That's great

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.150
Gee, Senior Yui is so dependent

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.000
Because you're so overprotective of her

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:39.480
Yeah, she's a senior already. All she does is slack off and eat in the clubroom every day. She only practices when I get mad at her.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:53.110
So you're saying that she should learn to be more responsible now? Well, of course. If senior Yui was a bit more responsible...

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:05.140
huh what are you looking at you mean this a text message from my sis

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:15.510
we chan your sister's a funny girl very carefree why'd you say that i got one too from a senior

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:25.090
in our jazz club here read it please take care of the freshman so responsible oh oh it's a message

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:30.000
from senior yui remember to feed time

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.970
Oh, embarrassing.

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:37.080
Maybe the light music club is...

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:58.500
Legendary golden chocolate bread!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.000
It's the first time I've ever seen it!

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:01.890
I never knew they had these.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:06.500
We make three a day, and the seniors always buy them all every day.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.220
Jun-Chan?

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.480
Ah, great idea!

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:17.320
Jun-Chan?

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.810
It's my sister.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.130
What's the matter?

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.950
She left her lunchbox in the classroom and asked me to take it home for her.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.680
Um, this is kind of embarrassing, guys.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.650
Are you sure we're allowed to go in?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.470
Well, we're just here to get something.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.620
I think...

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.000
Singer?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:11.440
Yui sits somewhere around here I'm not sure though you're right hey where does

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:21.960
senior Mio sit I think this is her seat here ah you know what I kind of feel

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:29.920
cooler now well sure you do pull

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:33.800
What's this?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.480
Senior Ritsu.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:37.450
Where's Ui?

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:40.970
This is my sister's seat.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.630
She looks like she's in heaven.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.280
Hey, don't you feel a little bit lonely with your sister gone now?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:48.110
Huh?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:51.070
It'll be another two days before she gets back.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:54.050
Oh, you're right.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.170
She's not coming home tonight.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:57.780
You just realized that?

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.060
Huh?

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.280
Go stay over at your house tonight!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:09.570
And so, they'll both be staying over at my house tonight.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:13.040
In return, I have to help Joan with the Jazz Club rehearsal.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:17.820
Oh, there's so many instruments!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:22.280
Not even the brass band has as many instruments as we do.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.280
Do you really have that many members?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.260
I guess so.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.240
That's amazing!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.000
Yep. The Jazz Club is all about survival.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.640
that's why we have to practice every chance we get when the upperclassmen aren't here

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:42.810
oh my classroom so careless you haven't changed at all june

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:54.480
oh sorry we're june's friends she'll be back in a sec wait a sec are you senior azuza

00:06:54.480 --> 00:07:00.000
huh we have heard all about you from senior june she told us that a really great

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:03.530
guitarist from the Light Music Club would be helping us.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:07.600
Uh, she, she said that?

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:11.440
Good, right on time.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.110
Good afternoon.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.130
Afternoon.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.730
These two girls are our freshman members.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:21.960
Hey Azusa, why don't you teach them a little guitar?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:27.450
Uh, two, three, four.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:30.000
One, two, three, four.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:33.670
Don't worry, this part is tough.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.400
My fingers don't seem to move well.

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:41.170
Well, why don't we all stretch our fingers, then?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:45.620
Hold out your left hand like this, palm out, the hand you don't use to strum.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:51.530
Move your index finger away from your middle finger, then do what I'm doing, and then do

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.580
it with your ring finger and pinky.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.220
One, two, three, four.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:58.970
One, two, three, four.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.000
It's too hard!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.570
Ui can do it.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:10.540
I stretch together with my sister every day.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:14.130
If you do it while you take a bath or before practice,

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:17.020
your fingers will slowly become much more flexible.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.220
Right!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.070
Huh?

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.460
Unchan!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.960
What happened?

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.560
Now I can't move my fingers!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.310
Huh?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:29.560
A pig!

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.090
Ooh, ooh, is that lame?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:39.250
Anyone home?

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:43.150
Coming here!

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:44.810
Come, Jun-chan!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.280
Here, I brought you something.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:50.020
Please take it, I hope you like it.

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:51.960
Thank you!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.080
Ah, donuts!

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:55.010
Mm-hmm!

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.350
The Super All-Star Pack!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.640
I've always wanted to buy it!

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:18.900
we have an extra person tonight I made a bit more let's see now got some shirashi and frozen pizza

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:28.710
no no it's more than enough told me to bring these for you

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.560
What's inside?

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:34.160
Oh?

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.700
Just some sushi.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.810
The donuts won't go!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.910
Huh?

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:40.710
Ugh!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.990
I ate too much.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.290
I'm so full.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.110
Huh?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.350
Did you have to take a bite of everyone?

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:53.460
Well, I wanted to try all the different flavors.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.630
Oh, Zuza, you finish the rest of it.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:58.480
Huh?

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:07.170
Oh you can never have enough dessert. The chocolate one's really good.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:16.900
Oh, can I eat it? It's sweet.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:26.240
What's it say? Looks really fun.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:29.510
Are you guys having fun with your sleepover?

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.300
What's up?

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:45.980
I'm already asleep.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:46.980
Wow, she's good.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.860
We should go to sleep now, too.

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:52.250
Alrighty.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.650
But I'm not really sleepy yet.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.760
Then let's talk while we're lying down.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:00.000
Lights up!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:07.470
I'm so sure the seniors are having a whole lot of fun right now.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.400
Maybe they're fast asleep already.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:11.850
I don't think so.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:15.640
We stayed up really late every night during our trip.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:16.830
I bet.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:19.370
Souvenirs!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.000
They do that.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:38.990
Uh, I wish I was there.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:43.610
Hey, where should we go tomorrow?

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.880
Huh?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.020
Is there anywhere you really wanna go?

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:53.230
Uh, well, I... the zoo, I guess.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.170
Go there too!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:56.990
Really?

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.570
Yeah!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.070
Huh?

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:05.410
Again?

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.110
Huh?

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:29.510
Question.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.200
It's raining.

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:02.310
You don't have to do that.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.920
Azusa-chan, is it up too high?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.350
It's just right.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.520
I love your hair, Azusa.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.180
It's so black and straight.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.080
Yeah?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:16.250
People always tell me I look like an anime figurine, so I hate it.

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.120
Your hair is to die for!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:20.890
I really hate trying to fix mine every day.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.620
Especially on a rainy day like today.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.400
You see what I mean?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.680
Wow, your hair's really frizzy.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:29.720
Oh!

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:38.830
I don't think we can go to the zoo.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.040
Hey Jun, is there anything cool we could do?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:48.440
You wanna go somewhere, maybe?

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.520
I'm fine with playing games, too.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.520
Oh.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.520
What's that?

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.040
I don't think we can go to the zoo.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.050
Hey Jun, is there anything cool we could do?

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:59.010
You wanna go somewhere, maybe?

00:13:59.010 --> 00:13:59.190
I'm fine with playing games, too.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.880
Louie, you don't have volume six, do you?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.160
Uh, I have to go check.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:09.450
You're going to lose a friend if this is how you behave at your friend's house, Jun.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:14.020
If I recall correctly, it should be on my sister's bookshelf.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:17.670
Oh, so this is your sister's room.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.940
Yep.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.250
Hey, those are...

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.840
Ah, she brought a ton of that stuff back home recently.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.190
That's from when we cleaned the closet.

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:29.760
Ah, this must be guitar.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.300
Wow, it's so cool!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.820
Let's see, here it is! Volume 7!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.700
But I wanted volume 6.

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:43.160
But there's only volume 7 and up.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.300
It's just one volume, who cares?

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.890
Oh, I guess.

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.170
I'll take it.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:52.160
Chilly, never mind!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.010
I think we should go to the bookstore!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:54.740
Huh?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.350
But it's pouring outside.

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.910
Uh, bleh!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:05.430
That's why I was asking you if you had any ideas for what to do.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:06.830
Huh?

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.920
Oh, it's Senior Yui.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:13.880
As I knew, what are you guys doing?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:19.540
Nothing, guys.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.780
She's asleep again!

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:27.100
Why did we have to come to the batting center?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:27.950
Ugh!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.000
I was reading a baseball comic, so I decided...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.990
to give it a try. Whoa!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:35.260
Who are you supposed to hit these balls?

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:38.870
I'm going to try the claw crane, okay?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.080
She gave up fast.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.240
How's it going?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.240
It's really, really hard.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.490
Stay focused on the ball.

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:49.730
Wait for it to come close.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.650
And pretend that's a wall over here.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:56.460
Swing! Got it?

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:59.540
Yeah.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:02.650
Wait for it to come close.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.600
Pretend that there's a wall here.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:08.640
Huh?

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:09.570
Cool.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:19.810
Ui's such a fast learner, not fair.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.920
Just like Senior Yui, they pick things up fast.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:26.070
Keep you waiting.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:26.980
That's huge!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:28.620
Is that for hitting a home run?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:29.540
Yeah.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.250
Great, but where are you going to put it, Uli-chan?

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.420
It's ten of Tan-chan.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:37.150
Huh?

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:38.120
What's the matter?

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.800
Tan-chan...

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.100
I forgot...

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:58.230
Tan-chan...

00:16:58.230 --> 00:16:59.730
Eh-heh...

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.920
So this is Tan-Chan.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.020
It is really cute.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.060
It's cute?

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:12.900
My sister's always telling me that it's really cute like Azunyan.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:17.550
Cute like me?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:24.160
You're six guys, aren't you glad we came?

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:29.280
Well, I am glad I got to see Tan-Chan.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.770
But, uh...

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:34.230
When's the rain gonna stop?

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.600
Yeah, I mean, it's Sunday.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.230
Hmm.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.870
Well, then, why don't we just have a jam session right here?

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:47.980
It's raining really hard outside, so it should be okay if we're really loud.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:49.800
Just us three?

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.980
It's like a lot of fun!

00:17:54.260 --> 00:18:00.000
Hey, we'll play some easy songs!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.020
You can play the organ, right?

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.920
Yeah, I played it when I was little.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.080
Try it, try it!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:08.780
Sure.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:12.000
Jun, do you have a spare guitar in the jazz room?

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.750
Yeah, give me a sec, I'll go get it.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.270
- Three.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:12.010
Wow, that was right guys!

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.280
Huh?

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.550
No rain.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.410
Huh?

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:16.960
What?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:34.210
I'm sis.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:38.770
Says I miss Tita.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.600
Suza, move up a little.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.580
Ready?

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:50.720
Do it.

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.850
Cheese.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:58.040
Great.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.210
- Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.290
- Louie, please bring volume seven.

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:07.130
- Okay.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:11.280
- Attention, and don't miss your stop.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.390
- She'll be okay.

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:19.170
We had a lot of fun today, didn't we?

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:54.210
Maybe I should hide

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.280
What's the matter?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.320
I got you something, Azunian.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:15.010
Everyone's waiting for you in the club room now.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.160
Can I go later?

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.440
No, you can't.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:20.800
Mookie-chan's already prepared tea.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.440
See you guys later!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:29.640
Wait, Azunian!

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:33.750
Club? This is my souvenir?

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.240
Yup! This one is mine!

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.740
Oh?

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:41.900
Ready? Go!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.460
Spells...

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:49.630
Club Music Light! 'Cause we love to play club music!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:50.530
That's not right!

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:51.670
Club Light Music!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:54.530
